<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n61604" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαθρ-αῖς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, also
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Eub.
			67.8
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Lyc.
			1198
		</span></i>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>secret,
				clandestine</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄτη λ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					1230
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰσδέδεγμαι πημονὴν . .
			λαθραῖον</span>, of a person, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				377
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ. ὃς ἀσκεῖ κακά</span>
			practises <i>secret</i> frauds, ib.<i><span class="en">
				384
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EN</u>
				1131a6
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ. ὠδίς</span> one born in
				<i>secret</i> child-birth, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ion</u>
				45
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ. θάνατον ἐπιβουλεύειν τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					And.
					4.15
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ. Κύπρις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eub.
				</span></i>
			 l. c.: 
				Comp.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαθραιότερον, γένος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					781a
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Adv. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αίως</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				1077
			</span></i> (anap.), <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>El.</u>
				26
			</span></i>, etc.: 
				Sup.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡς μάλιστα δύνανται λαθραιότατα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antipho
					1.28
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ. τῆς μητρός</span>
			<i>clam matre</i>, 
				f.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λάθρᾳ</span>
			 in <i><span class="en">
				Alciphr.
				3.27
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>involuntarily</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὖρα . . προϊόντα λ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Coac.</u>
					136
				</span></i>
			; <i>without obvious cause</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ. τελευτῶσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Prorrh.</u>
					1.128
				</span></i>
			.</div>
